nk you for  sharing it great to see you back on TV  we're gonna see more more after these  six episodes Maureen well you know  there's been there they're already in  development yes thank you I think you're  gonna let it by request two of people do  do someone in their lives who they want  to meet again so I yeah thank you guys  it's been great to sit with you thank  you thank you Andy and we'll meet again  premieres Tuesday on PBS January 23rd  and you can hear more from Anne in this  week's issue of People magazine as well
 

